  slide "A · Coordinator pipeline" {
    eyebrow: "RUNNERV2COORDINATOR::HANDLE"
    title: "The ten-step pipeline"
    lede: "Validate, lower, select, prepare, execute — a fixed order with one branch after step 8."
    narration: "Component A continued — RunnerV2Coordinator::handle runs a fixed ten-step pipeline. Steps 1–3 validate_outer, into_authored, validate_selection; 4–5 validate_endpoint_profiles and sidecar_inputs.prepare; 6–8 RunnerRunContext::new, pair validate_run, report_provenance; 9–10 prepare_with_context and operation.execute. After step 8 the operation branches: Validate emits RunValidationV2 { Static } and exits 0; Execute continues through steps 9–10 to RunTerminalV2 { report_path }."
    caption: "Ten ordered steps · one branch after provenance."
